WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
<v Dee>Are all the names still at their tables?</v>

00:06.500 --> 00:11.000
<v Uncle Ray>Every one — some got older, and none got easier.</v>

00:11.000 --> 00:12.500
<v Dee>And him?</v>

00:12.500 --> 00:15.000
<v Pat>Still keeps his own hours.</v>

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
<v Uncle Ray>Still winning.</v>

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
<v Dee>I'm not building a bridge. I'm bringing a partner.</v>

00:24.000 --> 00:27.500
<v Uncle Ray>Then the day just got honest.</v>
